  <Copyright Notice="© Avolites Ltd. 2018" />
  <Thumbnail>fa00731f-edcf-4766-9c92-9ad70525c4ea</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="07-02-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (charts only - limited range information.  no blade calibration details)" />
  <History Date="16-02-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised in line with latest charts (date 2018-02-09, SW Main V11)." />
  <History Date="16-02-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="(added colour names and blade control functions/macros, revised frost + blade module rot ranges, changed blade channel assignment + added effect channels)" />
  <History Date="16-02-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from S350 to Impression S350.  Added product thumbnail." />
  <History Date="24-08-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated again! Now in line with latest charts (firmware version V24-31-21-22) note charts have dimmer default at 50%.  This is surely wrong." />
  <History Date="24-08-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's.  Added gobo swatches." />
  <History Date="25-10-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed gobo rot ranges.  Exported updated R20.  Revised Atlabase mode ID." />
  <Manual Filename="" Summary="" />
